      "html": "<div class=\"ds-record\"><div class=\"ds-record-head\"><p class=\"ds-data\">21:14 <span class=\"ds-sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span> <span class=\"ds-src\">voicemail</span></p><p class=\"ds-wall-label\">Sample</p></div><blockquote class=\"ds-record-quote\"><p>\"Hi it's Dana at 14 Rowe, the furnace is making a noise again, can someone come tomorrow morning\"</p></blockquote><dl class=\"ds-record-list\"><div class=\"ds-record-row\"><dt class=\"ds-wall-label\">Caller</dt><dd class=\"ds-data\"><svg class=\"ds-mark ds-mark-filled\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 8.5l3 3 7-7\"/></svg>Dana Whitlock</dd></div><div class=\"ds-record-row\"><dt class=\"ds-wall-label\">Address</dt><dd class=\"ds-data\"><svg class=\"ds-mark ds-mark-filled\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 8.5l3 3 7-7\"/></svg>14 Rowe St</dd></div><div class=\"ds-record-row\"><dt class=\"ds-wall-label\">Window</dt><dd class=\"ds-data\"><svg class=\"ds-mark ds-mark-held\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"/><path d=\"M5 8h6\"/></svg>Held for a person</dd></div></dl></div>",
